WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.705
Video 23. Users, passwords, security, ane Edit
Log.

00:00:06.905 --> 00:00:12.329
Maalik security chaalu kare chhe, ane darek
vyakti maate user banaave chhe.

00:00:12.259 --> 00:00:18.355
Darek user no ek role hoy chhe, ane e naam ane
password thi log in kare chhe.

00:00:18.285 --> 00:00:22.887
Edit Log darek pherphaar raakhe chhe, user ane
samay saathe.

00:00:23.187 --> 00:00:28.778
Alt+K thi Company menu khule chhe. Y etle
Security.

00:00:28.808 --> 00:00:34.380
Control User Access ne Yes karo. Maalik
administrator chhe.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:41.072
Ctrl+A maalik no password be vaar maage chhe.
Ene surakshit jagyae raakho.

00:00:42.152 --> 00:00:49.454
Alt+K, P thi Users and Passwords khule chhe.
Alt+C thi user bane chhe.

00:00:49.484 --> 00:00:59.635
Role Data Entry pasand karo, ane naam lakho. Data Entry vouchers
ane masters banaave chhe, security nathi kholi shaktu.

00:00:59.665 --> 00:01:05.191
Ctrl+A user no password maage chhe. Have priya
list ma chhe.

00:01:09.915 --> 00:01:13.428
Ctrl+F3 thi company bandh thaay chhe.

00:01:14.129 --> 00:01:21.740
Alt+F3 thi e fari khule chhe. Hisaab dar
vakhte naam ane password maage chhe.

00:01:22.129 --> 00:01:28.665
Priya log in kare chhe. Ena Company menu ma
Security ane Users nathi.

00:01:31.179 --> 00:01:35.441
Priya Day Book khole chhe, ane payment pasand
kare chhe.

00:01:35.471 --> 00:01:40.124
E rakam 30,000 thi badline 18,500 kare chhe.

00:01:40.824 --> 00:01:47.231
Ctrl+A thi save thaay chhe. Day Book ma navi
rakam dekhaay chhe.

00:01:47.261 --> 00:01:54.100
Voucher ma Alt+Q thi eno Edit Log dekhaay
chhe: priya e payment badlyu, ane samay.

00:01:54.261 --> 00:02:00.254
Alt+K, L company ma thayela pherphaar bataave
chhe, user ane samay saathe.

00:02:01.590 --> 00:02:07.500
Darek vyakti ne user aapo. Edit Log darek
pherphaar raakhe chhe.

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:09.740
Have pachhi: office network.

